Grammar

    0 $accept: prog $end

    1 prog: let

    2 dec: tydec
    3    | vardec
    4    | fundec

    5 tydec: TYPE ID EQ ty

    6 ty: ID
    7   | RBRACE tyfields LBRACE
    8   | ARRAY OF ID

    9 tyfields: ID COLON ID tyfields
   10         | COMMA tyfields
   11         | ε

   12 vardec: VAR ID ASSIGN exp
   13       | VAR ID COLON ID ASSIGN exp

   14 fundec: FUNCTION ID RPAREN tyfields LPAREN EQ exp
   15       | FUNCTION ID RPAREN tyfields COLON ID LPAREN EQ exp

   16 let: LET dec IN exp END
   17    | ε

   18 exp: ID
   19    | INT


